      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會幫忙把寶可夢的基礎點數變得空溜溜，\n就像什麼都沒發生過一樣，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n重新開始全新的每一天。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167035E6B5FD9628A5BF653EF5922768457FA790E9EDE65788B8A5F977A7A6E9C6E9CFF0C000A5C3150CF4EC09EBC90FD6C92767C751F904E4E006A23FF0C00100001BE00000A91CD65B0958B59CB516865B076846BCF4E00592930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要變得空溜溜，\n必須給我<U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002><U+0000>個超級碎片。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n想變得空溜溜時，就來找我啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818B8A5F977A7A6E9C6E9CFF0C000A5FC598087D66621100100003020400020000500B8D857D1A788E7247300200100001BE00000A60F38B8A5F977A7A6E9C6E9C6642FF0C5C314F86627E6211554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是空溜溜大姐頭。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
